# Two ways to run the agents. Pick one.
#
# 1. Your Claude subscription (Pro/Max): install Claude Code, run `claude` once
#    to sign in, and leave ANTHROPIC_API_KEY empty. Usage counts against your plan.
#
# 2. The Anthropic API (pay per use): paste a key from https://platform.claude.com
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional: force one engine (auto, api, claude-code). Default: auto.
# PAID_OR_PIVOT_ENGINE=auto
# Optional: which Claude model the agents use (default claude-sonnet-5-5)
# PAID_OR_PIVOT_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5-5
